{"batch_number":36,"batch_size":96,"cases":[{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"census-newsroom-zh-hans-v1/page-01-sentence-011","input":"如果有与 2010 年人口普查指标做对比的 2020 年人口普查指标，人口普查局也将发布此指标。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.census.gov/newsroom/press-releases/2020/2020-census-quality-assessments/2020-census-quality-assessments-chinese-simplified.html","source_case_id":"page-01-sentence-011","split":"press_release_01"},"source_id":"census-newsroom-zh-hans-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"census-newsroom-zh-hans-v1/page-01-sentence-017","input":"在接下来的四年中，人口普查局将对 2020 年人口普查的运作情况进行评估和测评(仅英语)，并向公众公布相关信息。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.census.gov/newsroom/press-releases/2020/2020-census-quality-assessments/2020-census-quality-assessments-chinese-simplified.html","source_case_id":"page-01-sentence-017","split":"press_release_01"},"source_id":"census-newsroom-zh-hans-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"census-newsroom-zh-hans-v1/page-01-sentence-026","input":"除了通过上述活动分析普查流程，还通过与其他人口总数做比较来评估普查。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.census.gov/newsroom/press-releases/2020/2020-census-quality-assessments/2020-census-quality-assessments-chinese-simplified.html","source_case_id":"page-01-sentence-026","split":"press_release_01"},"source_id":"census-newsroom-zh-hans-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"census-newsroom-zh-hans-v1/page-01-sentence-038","input":"人口普查局将使用该信息并利用机会进行革新，为下一个十年，也就是 2030 年的人口普查做好准备。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.census.gov/newsroom/press-releases/2020/2020-census-quality-assessments/2020-census-quality-assessments-chinese-simplified.html","source_case_id":"page-01-sentence-038","split":"press_release_01"},"source_id":"census-newsroom-zh-hans-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"census-newsroom-zh-hans-v1/page-02-sentence-010","input":"现在比以往任何时候都更容易自行回答，都不需要与人口普查员见面。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.census.gov/newsroom/press-releases/2020/census-day/census-day-chinese-simiplified.html","source_case_id":"page-02-sentence-010","split":"press_release_02"},"source_id":"census-newsroom-zh-hans-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"census-newsroom-zh-hans-v1/page-02-sentence-011","input":"这一点非常重要，因为目前国家、州和地方卫生当局正在提供健康和安全指导。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.census.gov/newsroom/press-releases/2020/census-day/census-day-chinese-simiplified.html","source_case_id":"page-02-sentence-011","split":"press_release_02"},"source_id":"census-newsroom-zh-hans-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"census-newsroom-zh-hans-v1/page-02-sentence-020","input":"然后，请确保您的朋友、家庭和社交网络了解回答的重要性，并鼓励他们完成人口普查。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.census.gov/newsroom/press-releases/2020/census-day/census-day-chinese-simiplified.html","source_case_id":"page-02-sentence-020","split":"press_release_02"},"source_id":"census-newsroom-zh-hans-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"census-newsroom-zh-hans-v1/page-03-sentence-010","input":"第二波软启动可能于 7 月末进行，将宣布设立更多的地区人口普查办公室 (area census offices)。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.census.gov/newsroom/press-releases/2020/2020-additional-operations/ensure-accurate-census-count-chinese-simplified.html","source_case_id":"page-03-sentence-010","split":"press_release_03"},"source_id":"census-newsroom-zh-hans-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"census-newsroom-zh-hans-v1/page-03-sentence-025","input":"普查后问卷调查访谈定于 9 月 23 日至 12 月 22 日进行。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.census.gov/newsroom/press-releases/2020/2020-additional-operations/ensure-accurate-census-count-chinese-simplified.html","source_case_id":"page-03-sentence-025","split":"press_release_03"},"source_id":"census-newsroom-zh-hans-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"census-newsroom-zh-hans-v1/page-03-sentence-031","input":"人口普查统计数据在接下来的十年内将帮助确定每个州 (state) 在美国众议院中的席位，并确定每年成百上千亿美元的联邦资金将如何在州 (state) 和社区分配。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.census.gov/newsroom/press-releases/2020/2020-additional-operations/ensure-accurate-census-count-chinese-simplified.html","source_case_id":"page-03-sentence-031","split":"press_release_03"},"source_id":"census-newsroom-zh-hans-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"census-newsroom-zh-hans-v1/page-04-sentence-004","input":"3 月 12 日至 3 月 20 日之间的人口普查邀请将包括 12 种非英语语言的插页，邀请人们用自己的语言通过在线或电话回答。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.census.gov/newsroom/press-releases/2020/languages/languages-chinese-simiplified.html","source_case_id":"page-04-sentence-004","split":"press_release_04"},"source_id":"census-newsroom-zh-hans-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"census-newsroom-zh-hans-v1/page-04-sentence-005","input":"大约 1300 万住户（约 9%）将同时收到英语和西班牙语版的邀请。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.census.gov/newsroom/press-releases/2020/languages/languages-chinese-simiplified.html","source_case_id":"page-04-sentence-005","split":"press_release_04"},"source_id":"census-newsroom-zh-hans-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"census-newsroom-zh-hans-v1/page-05-sentence-001","input":"2020 年 5 月 27 日 —随着超过 60% 的美国住户回答 2020 年人口普查，2020 年人口普查工作正在按计划稳步进行，每五家住户中约有四家选择通过网站 2020census.gov在线自行回答。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.census.gov/newsroom/press-releases/2020/2020-census-60-percent/60-percent-chinese-simplified.html","source_case_id":"page-05-sentence-001","split":"press_release_05"},"source_id":"census-newsroom-zh-hans-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"census-newsroom-zh-hans-v1/page-05-sentence-011","input":"人口普查局的在线回答率地图显示了各州 (state)、市 (city)、县和人口普查区的回答率。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.census.gov/newsroom/press-releases/2020/2020-census-60-percent/60-percent-chinese-simplified.html","source_case_id":"page-05-sentence-011","split":"press_release_05"},"source_id":"census-newsroom-zh-hans-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"census-newsroom-zh-hans-v1/page-05-sentence-012","input":"Wisconsin 州的 Madison 是互联网自发回应率最高的市 (city)。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.census.gov/newsroom/press-releases/2020/2020-census-60-percent/60-percent-chinese-simplified.html","source_case_id":"page-05-sentence-012","split":"press_release_05"},"source_id":"census-newsroom-zh-hans-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"census-newsroom-zh-hans-v1/page-05-sentence-016","input":"人口普查局强烈鼓励公众在网站 2020census.gov在线回答。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.census.gov/newsroom/press-releases/2020/2020-census-60-percent/60-percent-chinese-simplified.html","source_case_id":"page-05-sentence-016","split":"press_release_05"},"source_id":"census-newsroom-zh-hans-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"census-newsroom-zh-hans-v1/page-06-sentence-001","input":"2020 年 6 月 12 日 –美国人口普查局继续监控新冠病毒 (COVID-19)对 2020 年人口普查操作的影响，并遵照联邦、州 (state) 和地方卫生部门的指导方针以确保工作人员和公众的安全。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.census.gov/newsroom/press-releases/2020/update-census-operations/update-census-operations-chinese-simplified.html","source_case_id":"page-06-sentence-001","split":"press_release_06"},"source_id":"census-newsroom-zh-hans-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"census-newsroom-zh-hans-v1/page-06-sentence-003","input":"截止今天，已经有超过 9000 万住户回答了 2020 年人口普查，每五个住户中超过四个住户通过在线回答。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.census.gov/newsroom/press-releases/2020/update-census-operations/update-census-operations-chinese-simplified.html","source_case_id":"page-06-sentence-003","split":"press_release_06"},"source_id":"census-newsroom-zh-hans-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"census-newsroom-zh-hans-v1/page-06-sentence-005","input":"以下概述的操作更新信息包括更新/普查、未回复随访、Alaska 偏远地区操作、合作关系活动、移动问卷帮助 (MQA) 计划以及综合交流和合作关系宣传活动。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.census.gov/newsroom/press-releases/2020/update-census-operations/update-census-operations-chinese-simplified.html","source_case_id":"page-06-sentence-005","split":"press_release_06"},"source_id":"census-newsroom-zh-hans-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"census-newsroom-zh-hans-v1/page-06-sentence-008","input":"由于这些地区地理位置偏远，有其独特的挑战性，人口普查员将亲自收集人口普查答案，而不是邀请住户通过在线、电话或邮件回答。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.census.gov/newsroom/press-releases/2020/update-census-operations/update-census-operations-chinese-simplified.html","source_case_id":"page-06-sentence-008","split":"press_release_06"},"source_id":"census-newsroom-zh-hans-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"census-newsroom-zh-hans-v1/page-06-sentence-015","input":"将在六月底宣布六个 ACO。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.census.gov/newsroom/press-releases/2020/update-census-operations/update-census-operations-chinese-simplified.html","source_case_id":"page-06-sentence-015","split":"press_release_06"},"source_id":"census-newsroom-zh-hans-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"census-newsroom-zh-hans-v1/page-06-sentence-017","input":"除了作为软发布的一部分的 ACO 之外，所有剩余的 ACO 将于 8 月 11 日开始进行未回复随访，并在 10 月 31 日或之前结束。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.census.gov/newsroom/press-releases/2020/update-census-operations/update-census-operations-chinese-simplified.html","source_case_id":"page-06-sentence-017","split":"press_release_06"},"source_id":"census-newsroom-zh-hans-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"census-newsroom-zh-hans-v1/page-06-sentence-024","input":"如果人们通常不住在其他地方，而是住在露营地、房车公园、游艇码头和宾馆，人口普查员会在 9 月 3 日到 9 月 28 日之间算上他们。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.census.gov/newsroom/press-releases/2020/update-census-operations/update-census-operations-chinese-simplified.html","source_case_id":"page-06-sentence-024","split":"press_release_06"},"source_id":"census-newsroom-zh-hans-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"census-newsroom-zh-hans-v1/page-06-sentence-027","input":"在当地政府指导方针的协调下，合作伙伴关系专员于 6 月初恢复了面对面的工作，与 37 万多个合作伙伴组织合作，并在全国各地安全的区域参加了面对面活动。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.census.gov/newsroom/press-releases/2020/update-census-operations/update-census-operations-chinese-simplified.html","source_case_id":"page-06-sentence-027","split":"press_release_06"},"source_id":"census-newsroom-zh-hans-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"census-newsroom-zh-hans-v1/page-06-sentence-035","input":"其他付费媒体计划在七月、八月和九月开展工作。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.census.gov/newsroom/press-releases/2020/update-census-operations/update-census-operations-chinese-simplified.html","source_case_id":"page-06-sentence-035","split":"press_release_06"},"source_id":"census-newsroom-zh-hans-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"census-newsroom-zh-hans-v1/page-06-sentence-037","input":"扩展后的语言信息将为付费搜索、印刷或数字广告的组合。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.census.gov/newsroom/press-releases/2020/update-census-operations/update-census-operations-chinese-simplified.html","source_case_id":"page-06-sentence-037","split":"press_release_06"},"source_id":"census-newsroom-zh-hans-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"census-newsroom-zh-hans-v1/page-06-sentence-043","input":"今天，人口普查局宣布了算上无家可归人士的更新计划。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.census.gov/newsroom/press-releases/2020/update-census-operations/update-census-operations-chinese-simplified.html","source_case_id":"page-06-sentence-043","split":"press_release_06"},"source_id":"census-newsroom-zh-hans-v1"},{"classification":{"confidence":null,"domain":null,"eligible":null,"notes":"","quality_flags":[],"risk":null,"script":null},"id":"census-newsroom-zh-hans-v1/page-07-sentence-013","input":"虽然从 8 月 11 日开始，人口普查员将开始拜访尚未回答的住户，但这些住户在 10 月 31 日拜访结束前都可以自行回答。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.census.gov/newsroom/press-releases/2020/additional-2020-reminder/additional-2020-reminder-chinese-simplified.html","source_case_id":"page-07-sentence-013","split":"press_release_07"},"source_id":"census-newsroom-